# cols 154-161) any enemy hit is fatal: the 36 px knock-up reaches the spikes. The valley pond is 2 wide (cols
# 167-168) so the jump over it has room after the overhang; the second lake floe is 5 wide so a landing at full
# speed can slide to a stop on it.
